WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.728
Before your first turn, you found your nation: a kingdom in a world of epic fantasy. The first time you play, the game opens its own nation builder, the same one players met in nineteen eighty-seven. It takes two minutes. Here is how.

2
00:00:17.953 --> 00:00:25.537
First, the name of your nation, up to nine letters. Every ruler will see it on the map. Type it and press Enter.

3
00:00:25.762 --> 00:00:36.463
Now a password for your nation, up to seven characters. Nothing shows while you type. The game asks for it every time you play, so keep it.

4
00:00:36.688 --> 00:00:38.263
Type it once more.

5
00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:42.148
The name of your ruler. The news will speak of them.

6
00:00:42.373 --> 00:00:55.877
Choose your people with one letter: dwarves, elves, humans or orcs. Dwarves are miners and warriors; elves, defenders and mages; orcs breed fast and fight in numbers. Humans are balanced, the easiest to begin with.

7
00:00:56.102 --> 00:01:05.517
Your class. Type its number and press Enter. King and emperor cost no points, and suit a first game.

8
00:01:05.742 --> 00:01:11.538
Good, neutral or evil. It shapes how the other kingdoms of the world see you.

9
00:01:11.763 --> 00:01:14.773
One letter marks your land on everyone's map.

10
00:01:14.998 --> 00:01:25.858
Now, the points. Each line is something your nation can buy. J moves down, K moves up, and Space buys one more of the marked line.

11
00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:34.446
A tip: buy two points of treasury. A nation without gold cannot draft troops in its first turn. Press Escape when you are done.

12
00:01:34.671 --> 00:01:40.156
The points you did not spend can become people. Press Y, then any key.

13
00:01:40.381 --> 00:01:45.074
Is your nation as you want it? Press Y.

14
00:01:45.299 --> 00:01:52.081
Save it with Y. Careful: any other key deletes the nation, and you start again.

15
00:01:52.306 --> 00:02:02.036
Your nation is in the world, among the other kingdoms. From now on, Play takes you straight to it, and the game asks for its password.

16
00:02:02.261 --> 00:02:10.879
That is all. Ask for an invite code, create your account, and found your nation. Then, your first turn.

